<title>UK: Export Finance sets 12 billion yen three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Export Finance sets 12 billion yen three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Taiheiyo Europe Ltd and Yamaichi International (Europe) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORT FINANCE AND INSURANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    12 BLN YEN    COUPON     5.40	MATURITY    29.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  L-27.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		REDEMPTION IN A$</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 500     SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
